  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日もいいステージだったぞ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "そのようなことは……\r\nお喜びいただき、うれしい限りです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そう、いつも通りだ……歌やダンスはうまくなってるし\r\n表情は少ないがきちんとファンサービスもする）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（厳しいレッスンの効果も出てきたのか\r\nファンは着実に増えてきてる……けど）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（なぜだろう……すべてうまくいってるのに\r\n何かがひっかかる……）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "あの……プロデューサーさま……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nああ、どうしたんだ、凛世",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "難しい顔を、されていましたので……\r\n何か、気になることでも……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "い、いや……何でもないよ\r\nいいライブだった",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま、\r\n申し訳、ございません……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "至らぬ点がございましたら、必ずお直しいたします……\r\nですから、凛世を、お見捨てなさいませんよう……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そうじゃないんだが……\r\nそうだな……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "自分のしたいことは\r\n何だ？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "何かを直してほしい\r\nわけじゃない",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "俺の気持ちを聞いて\r\nくれるか？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世は自分のやりたいことって何かあるか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030100,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "やりたい、こと……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030110,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまのご期待に、お応えする……\r\nそれだけが凛世の、望みです……",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……なるほど、凛世はまだ、アイドルとして\r\n自分のやりたいことが見つかっていないんだな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030120,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……申し訳ございません\r\n凛世が、至らないばかりに……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大丈夫だ\r\n謝るようなことじゃない",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに焦って探すものでもない。ゆっくりでいいんだ\r\n今はそれが見つからなくても、俺と一緒に見つけていこう",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030130,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまと、一緒に……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030140,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ありがとう、ございます……\r\nふふ……プロデューサーさまと、一緒に……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何かを直してほしいわけじゃないんだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今のやり方は、凛世らしくてすごくいいと思ってる\r\nけど……他にきっと新しい何かが必要なんだと思う",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030160,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "新しい、何か……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。それはたぶん……\r\n凛世がアイドルとしてやりたいこと、なんじゃないかな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030170,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それは……どうすれば、\r\n見つかるもの、なのでしょう……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わからない\r\nでも、きっと凛世自身が見つけなきゃいけないんだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030180,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……凛世に、できるでしょうか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も手伝うから\r\n一緒に、考えてみないか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030190,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……ありがとう、ございます\r\nプロデューサーさま",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030200,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世がアイドルとして、やりたいこと\r\n必ずや……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の気持ちを聞いてくれるか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030210,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……もちろんで、ございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、凛世に、最高のアイドルになってほしいと思ってる\r\n一緒にいつか、最高の舞台にたどり着きたい",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どんな仕事をやっていても、いつだってそのことを\r\n一番に考えるんだ。俺は凛世のプロデューサーだから",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030220,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030230,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世も、\r\nプロデューサーさまの、お望みならば……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。でも、アイドルとしての凛世の願いはなんだ？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030240,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世の……願い……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世がもっと成長するためには、俺のためじゃない、\r\n凛世自身のやりたいことを見つけなきゃいけないんだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからそれを探そう、凛世\r\n俺と一緒に",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001030250,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……かしこまりました、プロデューサーさま\r\nそれが貴方さまの、お望みなのですね……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200103/1012001030250"
  },
